lass="cty-n">Jivajirao Scindia</span><span class="cty-y">1916–1961</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:76.4%;width:18.0%"></span></span></li></ol><figcaption>5 people of the encyclopedia whose Wikidata record names this house as their family. Bright bars are lifespans; pale bars reigns or years of activity.</figcaption></figure><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/encyclopedia/dynasties">All ruling houses &rarr;</a></p></section>
